47,"Indicates the level at which the entity fits in an inheritance hierarchy. It is derived from the Inheritance Level of the entity's parent entity.
If the Inheritance Level for an entity is >1, the entity has at least one level of parental inheritance.  For example: ""3"" indicates the entity is at the third level, with a parent entity and a grandparent entity.",0
