62,"""The prefix the class or property that is the source for the data model entity/attribute/relationship.
Names in OWL 2 are IRIs, often written in a shorthand prefix:localname, where prefix: is a prefix name that expands to an IRI, and localname is the remainder of the name. For example: 
fibo-be-corp-corp:JointStockCompany
https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/Corporations/Corporations/JointStockCompany""
 ------ 
Original FIB-DM Label = enttPrefix",0
