8101,"Also called numeric-3 code in the specification, the three-digit numeric code representing the country name.  Recognizing that a numeric code for country names is of advantage (e.g. to provide language independence), a three-digit numeric (numeric-3) code from the range 000 to 899 is also provided in this part of IS0 3166.  It is made available by the United Nations Statistics Division.",0
